<%
  /**
   * admin/backup.ejs — export/import the whole site as one JSON document.
   * /js/admin.js reads the picked file as text and POSTs the raw JSON to
   * /api/admin/import.
   */
%>
<div class="page-header">
  <h1>💾 数据备份</h1>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-action="reload-site">🔄 重新加载数据</button>
</div>

<div id="backup-error" class="form-error" role="alert" hidden></div>

<section class="card">
  <h2>⬇️ 一键导出数据</h2>
  <p class="desc">将博客的全部数据（文章、页面、评论、动态、友链、访客权限、站点配置等）导出为单个 JSON 文件。可在更换服务器前备份数据，或用于日常归档。</p>
  <div class="form-actions">
    <button type="button" id="export-btn" class="btn btn-primary" data-action="export-backup">⬇️ 一键导出数据</button>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="card">
  <h2>⬆️ 一键导入数据</h2>
  <p class="warn">⚠️ 导入会先清空当前全部数据再写入备份内容，操作不可撤销，请确认备份文件无误。</p>
  <p class="desc">选择此前导出的备份文件，一键恢复全部数据。</p>
  <form id="import-form">
    <div class="file-row">
      <input type="file" id="import-file" accept="application/json,.json">
      <span id="file-name" class="file-name">未选择文件</span>
      <button type="submit" id="import-btn" class="btn btn-primary" data-action="import-backup">⬆️ 一键导入数据</button>
    </div>
  </form>
  <div id="result-box" class="result-box" hidden></div>
</section>
